Package: hmctdmr
Title: Bayesian Therapeutic Drug Monitoring with Hamiltonian Monte Carlo
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Moonsik",
           family = "Song",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "kimsa4485@gmail.com")
Description: Estimates individual pharmacokinetic parameters of amikacin,
    vancomycin, theophylline and phenytoin from sparse therapeutic drug
    monitoring data by Hamiltonian Monte Carlo (Stan/Torsten), and provides
    the matching mrgsolve models for posterior predictive simulation and
    dose recommendation.
